Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.65,Captions-PTS,,0,0,270,,{\blur0.3\fad(500,0)\fscx218\fscy210\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}灰色車站遺跡
